WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.935
The configuration holds the
agency's approved thresholds,

3
00:00:04.935 --> 00:00:08.325
and the tenant schedule fits
inside the block threshold.

4
00:00:08.325 --> 00:00:12.113
Lab 2 confirmed which activity
the revoke task writes.

5
00:00:12.113 --> 00:00:17.363
The run covers every separation in the
period, with no leaver left unblocked.

6
00:00:17.363 --> 00:00:23.376
Every late entry, re-enable, failed run and
early delete has an owner and a closure.

7
00:00:23.376 --> 00:00:26.288
Every privileged leaver
has a verified path.

8
00:00:26.288 --> 00:00:29.350
And the reader app holds
exactly two permissions.

9
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:33.938
Next, Chapter 7: lifecycle
drift, metrics and evidence.

10
00:00:33.938 --> 00:00:35.090
Thanks for watching.
